    "selected_houses_do_not_match_the_recomputed_head": "stop_and_report_verbatim",
    "planned_does_not_equal_succeeded_plus_failed": "stop_and_report_verbatim",
    "occupancy_value_missing_after_a_successful_pilot": "stop_and_report_verbatim",
    "regeneration_of_an_already_generated_house": "stop_and_report_verbatim",
    "may_replace_a_failed_house": false,
    "may_pick_houses_by_hand": false,
    "plain_language_zh": "以上任何一种都只有一个动作：原样停下并如实报告。例如算出来的 pilot house 与回执里写的不一致，正确做法是报告而不是把回执改成算出来的那四个。"
